Root's 2026-10-23 facts, stated as reported:
- The corrected custodian image ab589bf8 (image 70aadf…) is reproducibly built, with startup and reopen verified on AMD
  hardware at 20:16Z. It supersedes the quote-only c635fd68. It is not running; the original c866 image is live.
- There is no release, migration or rotation lifecycle proof yet.
- Only the sampled deployments are known (one EOA canary policy). The exhaustive log scan is incomplete.
- The book activations remain gated.
- No decentralized-custody or full-parity claim.
Docs only: the site build (release bafybeiax6ngccp7…, built from e24a47fb2) does not include docs/.
